t to a real instrument yet.","The list prints controller numbers only: every value is 0 - 127, and a setting chosen from a list (a model, a waveform, an effect type) is a number here, not a choice.","The manual: Tone Pitch and Echo BPM are two controllers each, MSB and LSB, the LSB to be sent first; they are laid out as printed, one parameter each.","Left out, the pedals, the wheel and bank select: 0 Bank Select MSB, 32 Bank Select LSB."],"coverage":{"singleParameterWrite":"complete-for-the-manual's-MIDI-controller-list","realtimeEditing":"complete-for-the-manual's-MIDI-controller-list","editBufferDumpRequest":"notImplemented","editBufferDumpParse":"notImplemented","bankDump":"notImplemented","inboundControllers":"the instrument sends these same messages when its panel is used, where its MIDI settings allow","verifiedOnHardware":false},"timing":{"minDelayBetweenMessagesMs":0},"tests":[{"name":"Global Level = 100 (CC 7)","parameter":"global.level","value":100,"expectedHex":"B0 07 64"},{"name":"Global Channel Focus = 100 (CC 70)","parameter":"global.channelFocus","value":100,"expectedHex":"B0 46 64"}]}}
